{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Yehudah, you.</b> You are the one fit for kingship, now that those preceding you have fallen from it, for no blemish is found in you that would make you unfit to rule." "<b>Your brothers shall acknowledge you.</b> They shall accept you as king, for they acknowledge you as fit to rule." "<b>Your hand on the neck of your enemies.</b> That they shall flee before you, as in וְנָתַתִּי אֶת כָּל אוֹיְבֶיךָ אֵלֶיךָ עֹרֶף (Exodus 23:27)." "<b>And your father's sons shall bow down to you.</b> You shall rule over all your father's sons, but not over the nations until Shiloh comes — for then not over your father's sons alone."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:16.192135495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}